count from 1 to 10:
    say it
count from 10 to 1 by 2:
    say it
count from 0 to 1 in steps of 0.25:
    say it
count from 1 to 3 and call each number n:
    say n
count from 1 to 3 as n:
    say n
count from 1 to limit plus 1 by step times 2 as n:
    say n
count from 1 to (limit as a number) as n:
    say n
count down from 10 to 1:
    say it
count down from 10 to 0 by 5 as n:
    say n
go from 0 to 100 in steps of 10:
    say it
go from 1 to 3 as n:
    say n
for each n from 1 to 3:
    say n
for each n from 3 to 1 in steps of 1:
    say n
